    "title": "Tolerate visual review snapshot",
    "category": "Visual review",
    "description": "Accept one changed snapshot's current rendering as an alternative to its baseline, in every future run. Only for named render noise over the threshold (anti-aliasing, font hinting, a cursor) at the same size, with `change_kind: pixel`, so check the images first. It cannot be undone through the API. Never use it to pass a gate: a story that renders differently from run to run gets `visual-review-repos-quarantine-create`, and an intended change gets approved and finalized. Pass the snapshot's UUID as `snapshot_id`, then call `visual-review-runs-recompute-create`.",
